units real
atom_style charge
boundary p p p 

read_data databox.in

pair_style reaxff NULL
pair_coeff * * ffield.reax.Fe_O_C_H Fe O

neighbor 2.0 bin
neigh_modify every 1 delay 0 check yes

fix qeq all qeq/reax 1 0.0 10.0 1.0e-6 reaxff

velocity all create 1000.0 12345 mom yes rot yes dist gaussian

fix nvt all nvt temp 1000.0 1000.0 100.0

timestep 0.25

thermo 100
thermo_style custom step temp pe ke etotal

dump 1 all xyz 100 traj.out

fix species all reaxff/species 100 1 100 species.out element Fe O

run 100000
